`#After wondering around the caverns for countless hours
`#you notice a sliver of light emanating from the side
`#of the cave.
`#
`#Should you check it out?  `l
@YESNO@
@##N
`#
`#You continue to wonder around.
@END@
@##Y
@CLEAR@
`#You notice a gap in the walls of the cave.
`#You slip through and notice a small patch
`#of beautiful flowers. Where could this light
`#be coming from?
`#
`%Should you investigate further?  `l
@YESNO@
@##N
`#You decide it better not to find out and
`#head out to the main part of the cavern.
@END@
@##Y
@CLEAR@
`#You take a look through the gap and see
`#a tunnel leading up to the surface.  Sunlight
`#pours down the tunnel onto the beautiful flowers.
`#
`%You feel as though something is watching you.
@MORE@
@RANDOM@ 2
@##1
`%You feel a small dart pierce your skin
`%After waking up, you find yourself back
`%in the cavern but more rested somehow.
@SEARCH@ 3
@END@
@##2
`%
`%A small pixie pops out of the flowers.
`%It gives you a kiss then flies away!
@CHARM@ 2
`%
`%You chase the pixie back into the caverns
